# Boolean fit checks (gate.sh), per the brief: a Ø 6.0 probe proxy (through
# the Ø 6.2 bore the +0.2 clearance cuts) seats with zero interference
# facets. The proxy is the NOMINAL size — never the bore size, which shares
# boundary faces with the bore wall and CGAL-resolves to a zero-volume
# facet shell, the exact false reading this check exists to prevent.
probe_seats  empty
gland_seats  empty
# Negative controls: the same proxies grown +0.6 mm past the whole tunable
# clearance band MUST interfere — else the empty proofs above prove nothing.
probe_jams   interferes
gland_jams   interferes
